+     *    plain stdClass (pure data, e.g. a page header built from YAML).
+     *  - $reflective false (json_encode, yaml_encode, string, to_json, yaml,
+     *    array): the object's class must be allow-listed by the active policy.
+     *
+     * No-op outside a sandboxed render, so trusted theme/plugin Twig is
+     * unaffected.
